\f1\b \cf0 1. Develop greater ownership and collaboration skills
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b Goal:
\f0\b0  
\f3 Build the skills needed to take on increasing responsibility for methodological projects, including coordinating work across teams, communicating with vendors and external partners, and contributing to research proposals and project planning.
\f0 \
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf0 Success looks like:
\f3\b0  Take on progressively more complex responsibilities within methodological projects; contribute to contract development, research proposals, and project planning; and demonstrate effective project management, collaboration, and communication when working with internal teams and external partners.
\f0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \

\f1\b 2. Develop skills in communicating and disseminating methodology to public audiences
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b Goal:
\f0\b0  
\f3 Develop skills in communicating methodological research to broader audiences by contributing to methods reports and public-facing materials, and by building experience sharing methodological work through journal publications, conference presentations, and professional talks. Engage with the broader survey research community through organizations such as AAPOR and DC-AAPOR, with the longer-term goal of establishing a strong professional reputation in survey methodology.
\f0 \

\f1\b Success looks like:
\f0\b0  
\f3 Produce clear and accessible methods reports and public-facing research products that translate complex methodological findings into materials useful to non-methodological audiences. Apply Pew\'92s style guidelines consistently and gain experience presenting and disseminating methodological work through appropriate professional and academic venues.
\f0 \
\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\pardeftab560\sl324\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 3.Provide methodological support to research teams through effective communication
\f0\b0 \

\f1\b Goal:
\f0\b0  Provide methodological and analytical support to research teams by understanding their underlying research needs and helping them identify appropriate and feasible approaches to address those needs.\

\f1\b Success looks like:
\f0\b0  Effectively clarify research teams\'92 needs and objectives, including when their initial request may not fully reflect what they are trying to accomplish; clearly communicate the feasibility, limitations, and tradeoffs of different approaches; and work collaboratively with teams to identify appropriate solutions or alternatives when a requested approach is not feasible.}